  "title": "Suffix IT Limited : Software Company in Bangladesh",
  "text": "Home\nAbout\nProducts\nIoT\nServices\nCareer\nContact\nStorage & Backup Service\nHomeStorage & Backup Service\nManaged storage and data backup solutions that are both efficient and cost-effective\n\nWith its Managed Storage & Backup services, Suffix IT makes it easier to protect business-critical data. We use a centralized storage approach that follows the ITIL service delivery principles. ISO and IEC operating criteria are also meticulously observed in order to maintain a highly efficient and well-oiled system. A daily backup service is also available, as well as a self-service portal that makes billing information and other specific reports more accessible.\n\nBenefits Of Storage & Backup\nContinual Risk Management\n\nOur skilled and experienced specialists maintain a thorough 24/7 proactive data monitoring system, making us one of the most trusted platforms for high-quality Managed Storage & Backup services.\n\nCustomized Data Storage Services\n\nOur self-service portal provides detailed billing, usage, and other report information. In addition, our daily backup service helps you improve the operational efficiency of your company.\n\nStrict Adherence To Industry Norms\n\nWe provide outstanding services by painstakingly following best practices and adhering to industry standards, such as the ITIL service delivery guidelines and ISO and IEC operating criteria.\n\nResponsible Backup And Recovery\n\nWith our online application backup and restoration capabilities, we protect your mission-critical IT resources while also improving performance and managing business risk.\n\nSchedule a Live Demo\nGo for a free practical demonstration in order to experience the user friendly platform of Suffix Field Force Management.\nREQUEST FOR A DEMO\n\nWe maintain strategic partnerships with multiple organizations in Bangladesh and worldwide, working together to deliver high-quality solutions and long-term value.\n\nCONTACT US\n\nCha-70,70/A, Rupayan Millennium Square (9A), Progoti Sharoni, North Badda, Gulshan, Dhaka-1212.\n\ninfo@suffixit.com\n\n+88 01958 424000\n\nQUICK LINKS\nAbout Us\nCareer\nContact Us\n\n© 2026 All Rights Reserved by Suffix IT Limited",
