      "text": "Storage & Backup Service"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h1",
      "text": "Managed storage and data backup solutions that are both efficient and cost-effective"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "With its Managed Storage & Backup services, Suffix IT makes it easier to protect business-critical data. We use a centralized storage approach that follows the ITIL service delivery principles. ISO and IEC operating criteria are also meticulously observed in order to maintain a highly efficient and well-oiled system. A daily backup service is also available, as well as a self-service portal that makes billing information and other specific reports more accessible."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h1",
      "text": "Benefits Of Storage & Backup"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h1",
      "text": "Continual Risk Management"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Our skilled and experienced specialists maintain a thorough 24/7 proactive data monitoring system, making us one of the most trusted platforms for high-quality Managed Storage & Backup services."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h1",
      "text": "Customized Data Storage Services"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Our self-service portal provides detailed billing, usage, and other report information. In addition, our daily backup service helps you improve the operational efficiency of your company."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h1",
      "text": "Strict Adherence To Industry Norms"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "We provide outstanding services by painstakingly following best practices and adhering to industry standards, such as the ITIL service delivery guidelines and ISO and IEC operating criteria."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h1",
      "text": "Responsible Backup And Recovery"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "With our online application backup and restoration capabilities, we protect your mission-critical IT resources while also improving performance and managing business risk."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h1",
      "text": "Schedule a Live Demo"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "Go for a free practical demonstration in order to experience the user friendly platform of Suffix Field Force Management."
    }
